MAD pin-set patch: vLLM changes for GLM-5.1 disaggregated serving
Upstream: https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm.git @ d626108b1841888ec90aced33367149a6bbc7e4b
Reproduces: fork commit 094820b5deeb1b93733586ca8942589e385a25dc of vllm.git (applying this to the upstream commit gives its tree exactly)
Fork commits:
  094820b5d [MoE][ROCm] MoRI combine() must use original (pre-dispatch) topk_ids (fixes 4P/4D EP32)
  448f0e883 [MoE][ROCm] Plumb mori max_total_recv_tokens (decouple recv capacity from send width)
  1624c7d1f [MoE][ROCm] Make MoRI EP sizing env-tunable (3.4x decode speedup)
  0c20e4198 [ROCm][DSA] Revert invalid-index sentinel -1->0 (fixes disagg decode GPU fault)
  3d4c1beee [ROCm][DSA] Bounds-guard sparse-indexer k-cache Triton kernel
  3b2111e71 [Compile] Split kv_cache_update ops out of compiled graph (v0.27 MLA fix)
  f2b832de8 [ROCm][MLA] Call concat_and_cache_mla positionally (v0.27 stable-ABI fix)
  b500b0ecc [ROCm][MoRIIO] Transfer DSA indexer KV cache prefill->decode (fixes long-context collapse)
  d3b3f08c1 [ROCm] Key sparse-MLA persistent metadata on per-request context lengths (disagg-hardened)
  4c0922c60 [ROCm][DSA] Map invalid token slots to -1 in sparse-MLA index kernel

